  "decision_conditions": [
    "Insufficient information has been submitted to discharge Condition 13 (Contaminated Land Assessment) of planning permission 23/02175/FUL. In particular, no Phase II intrusive site investigation has been undertaken to assess the nature and extent of potential contamination identified within the submitted Phase I assessment. As such, the Local Planning Authority cannot be satisfied that the site is suitable for its proposed residential use, nor that risks to human health and the environment have been adequately assessed or mitigated. The proposal therefore fails to accord with Policy DM10 of the Kingston Core Strategy (2012) and the requirements of the National Planning Policy Framework in respect of land contamination."
  ],
